# arabic: the Arabic script for Arabic, Persian and Urdu, from Noto Sans
# Arabic: its letters, its marks and its presentation forms. A font set
# adds this layer after Noto Sans Mono, which holds no Arabic, and the font
# draws at Noto Sans Mono's size.
#
# Arabic writes marks above and below the letters: hamza, the vowel marks
# (harakat) and shadda, sometimes two in a stack. Noto Sans Arabic's
# highest marks and its deepest letters reach past the text's height, so
# its glyphs may use the rows that the set's line spacing adds. Arabic is
# room by default, and the fit= line says so for the reader.
#
# License: SIL OFL 1.1.
#
# References:
# - ADR-1204 D5: the script layers.
# - ADR-1302 D13: line spacing and fit=.

role=script
source=font:Noto Sans Arabic
version=2.013
url=https://github.com/notofonts/arabic/releases/tag/NotoSansArabic-v2.013
fit=room
